{
  "_comment": [
    "Maps ML Kit's on-device image-labelling output onto food names Nure can look up.",
    "'specific' labels name an actual food and are used as the nutrition search term.",
    "'generic' labels only tell us the photo contains food; they raise confidence that",
    "we are looking at a meal but are never used as a search term on their own.",
    "Matching is case-insensitive. Labels not listed here are still offered as",
    "low-priority candidates, so extending this file only improves ranking - it is not",
    "required for the pipeline to work."
